# 基础词 Unit06
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit06核心词汇

{{damage}}{{/ˈdæmɪdʒ}}{{n./v. 损害；损失}}{{The storm caused serious damage to the buildings.}}
{{damp}}{{/dæmp}}{{adj./n. 潮湿的；湿气}}{{The clothes are still damp from the rain.}}
{{danger}}{{/ˈdeɪndʒər}}{{n. 危险；威胁}}{{Smoking is a danger to public health.}}
{{dare}}{{/deər}}{{v. 敢；胆敢}}{{She dared to challenge the traditional beliefs.}}
{{data}}{{/ˈdeɪtə}}{{n. 数据；资料}}{{The data shows a significant increase in sales.}}
{{dawn}}{{/dɔːn}}{{n./v. 黎明；开端}}{{They set off at dawn for the mountain hike.}}
{{deadline}}{{/ˈdedlaɪn}}{{n. 截止日期}}{{The deadline for submitting the report is next Friday.}}
{{deaf}}{{/def}}{{adj. 聋的；不愿听的}}{{He turned a deaf ear to our warnings.}}
{{deal}}{{/diːl}}{{v./n. 处理；交易；大量}}{{She has a lot of experience in dealing with difficult clients.}}
{{debate}}{{/dɪˈbeɪt}}{{n./v. 辩论；讨论}}{{The students held a debate on climate change.}}
{{debt}}{{/det}}{{n. 债务；欠款}}{{He is struggling to pay off his student debt.}}
{{decade}}{{/ˈdekeɪd}}{{n. 十年}}{{The city has changed dramatically over the past decade.}}
{{decay}}{{/dɪˈkeɪi}}{{v./n. 腐烂；衰退}}{{The old wooden house has begun to decay.}}
{{deceive}}{{/dɪˈsiːv}}{{v. 欺骗；蒙蔽}}{{He deceived everyone with his fake credentials.}}
{{decide}}{{/dɪˈsaɪd}}{{v. 决定；判决}}{{She decided to quit her job and travel the world.}}
{{declare}}{{/dɪˈkleər}}{{v. 宣布；声明}}{{The country declared independence in 1945.}}
{{decline}}{{/dɪˈklaɪn}}{{v./n. 下降；拒绝}}{{The company's profits have declined significantly.}}
{{decorate}}{{/ˈdekəreɪt}}{{v. 装饰；布置}}{{They decorated the room with balloons for the party.}}
{{decrease}}{{/dɪˈkriːs}}{{v./n. 减少；下降}}{{The number of accidents has decreased this year.}}
{{deed}}{{/diːd}}{{n. 行为；契约}}{{Good deeds should be recognized and rewarded.}}
{{deep}}{{/diːp}}{{adj./adv. 深的；深刻地}}{{The lake is very deep in the middle.}}
{{defeat}}{{/dɪˈfiːt}}{{v./n. 击败；失败}}{{Our team defeated the champions in the semifinals.}}
{{defend}}{{/dɪˈfend}}{{v. 防御；辩护}}{{The lawyer defended his client in court.}}
{{define}}{{/dɪˈfaɪn}}{{v. 定义；限定}}{{How do you define success?}}
{{definite}}{{/ˈdefɪnət}}{{adj. 明确的；确定的}}{{We need a definite answer by tomorrow.}}
{{degree}}{{/dɪˈɡriː}}{{n. 程度；学位；度数}}{{She earned a master's degree in engineering.}}
{{delay}}{{/dɪˈleɪ}}{{v./n. 延迟；推迟}}{{The flight was delayed by two hours due to fog.}}
{{deliberate}}{{/dɪˈlɪbərət}}{{adj./v. 故意的；深思熟虑的}}{{It was a deliberate attempt to mislead the public.}}
{{delicate}}{{/ˈdelɪkət}}{{adj. 精致的；脆弱的；微妙的}}{{The vase is very delicate, so handle it with care.}}
{{deliver}}{{/dɪˈlɪvər}}{{v. 递送；发表；接生}}{{The postman delivers mail every morning.}}
{{demand}}{{/dɪˈmɑːnd}}{{n./v. 需求；要求}}{{There is a growing demand for renewable energy.}}
{{democracy}}{{/dɪˈmɒkrəsi}}{{n. 民主；民主制度}}{{Democracy gives citizens the right to vote.}}
{{demonstrate}}{{/ˈdemənstreɪt}}{{v. 展示；证明；示威}}{{The experiment demonstrates the effect of gravity.}}
{{dense}}{{/dens}}{{adj. 密集的；浓密的}}{{The forest is so dense that sunlight barely reaches the ground.}}
{{deny}}{{/dɪˈnaɪ}}{{v. 否认；拒绝}}{{He denied any involvement in the scandal.}}
{{depart}}{{/dɪˈpɑːt}}{{v. 离开；出发}}{{The train departs at 8 o'clock sharp.}}
{{department}}{{/dɪˈpɑːtmənt}}{{n. 部门；系}}{{She works in the marketing department.}}
{{depend}}{{/dɪˈpend}}{{v. 依赖；取决于}}{{The outcome depends on several factors.}}
{{deposit}}{{/dɪˈpɒzɪt}}{{n./v. 存款；押金；沉积}}{{You need to pay a deposit when renting an apartment.}}
{{depress}}{{/dɪˈpres}}{{v. 使沮丧；使萧条}}{{The bad news depressed everyone in the office.}}
{{deprive}}{{/dɪˈpraɪv}}{{v. 剥夺；使丧失}}{{The war deprived many children of their education.}}
{{derive}}{{/dɪˈraɪv}}{{v. 源于；获得}}{{The word is derived from Latin.}}
{{describe}}{{/dɪˈskraɪb}}{{v. 描述；形容}}{{Can you describe what happened yesterday?}}
{{desert}}{{/ˈdezət}}{{n./v. 沙漠；遗弃}}{{The Sahara is the largest desert in Africa.}}
{{deserve}}{{/dɪˈzɜːv}}{{v. 应得；值得}}{{She deserves a promotion for her hard work.}}
{{design}}{{/dɪˈzaɪn}}{{n./v. 设计；计划}}{{The architect presented the design for the new building.}}
{{desire}}{{/dɪˈzaɪər}}{{n./v. 渴望；欲望}}{{He has a strong desire to succeed in life.}}
{{desperate}}{{/ˈdespərət}}{{adj. 绝望的；不顾一切的}}{{The refugees were in desperate need of food and water.}}
{{despite}}{{/dɪˈspaɪt}}{{prep. 尽管；不管}}{{Despite the rain, the event was a great success.}}
{{destination}}{{/ˌdestɪˈneɪʃn}}{{n. 目的地}}{{Paris is a popular tourist destination.}}
{{destroy}}{{/dɪˈstrɔɪ}}{{v. 破坏；摧毁}}{{The earthquake destroyed thousands of homes.}}
{{detail}}{{/ˈdiːteɪl}}{{n. 细节；详情}}{{Please explain the plan in detail.}}
{{detect}}{{/dɪˈtekt}}{{v. 发现；探测}}{{The sensor can detect changes in temperature.}}
{{determine}}{{/dɪˈtɜːmɪn}}{{v. 决定；确定}}{{Your attitude determines your altitude in life.}}
{{develop}}{{/dɪˈveləp}}{{v. 发展；开发；冲洗}}{{The country has developed rapidly in recent years.}}
{{device}}{{/dɪˈvaɪs}}{{n. 设备；装置}}{{A smartphone is a useful device for communication.}}
{{devote}}{{/dɪˈvəʊt}}{{v. 献身于；致力于}}{{She devoted her life to helping the poor.}}
{{diagram}}{{/ˈdaɪəɡræm}}{{n. 图表；图解}}{{The diagram shows the structure of the human body.}}
{{dialogue}}{{/ˈdaɪəlɒɡ}}{{n. 对话；对白}}{{The dialogue between the two characters was very interesting.}}
{{diamond}}{{/ˈdaɪəmənd}}{{n. 钻石；菱形}}{{The diamond ring was worth a fortune.}}
{{diary}}{{/ˈdaɪəri}}{{n. 日记；日记簿}}{{She keeps a diary to record her daily life.}}
{{dictate}}{{/dɪkˈteɪt}}{{v. 口述；命令；支配}}{{The manager dictated a letter to his secretary.}}
{{diet}}{{/ˈdaɪət}}{{n./v. 饮食；节食}}{{A balanced diet is essential for good health.}}
{{differ}}{{/ˈdɪfər}}{{v. 不同；意见不合}}{{Opinions differ on how to solve the problem.}}
{{digest}}{{/daɪˈdʒest}}{{v./n. 消化；摘要}}{{It takes time to digest a heavy meal.}}
{{digital}}{{/ˈdɪdʒɪtl}}{{adj. 数字的；数码的}}{{Digital technology has transformed the way we communicate.}}
{{dilemma}}{{/dɪˈlemə}}{{n. 进退两难；困境}}{{She faced a dilemma between career and family.}}
{{dimension}}{{/daɪˈmenʃn}}{{n. 维度；尺寸；方面}}{{The problem has several dimensions that need to be considered.}}
{{diminish}}{{/dɪˈmɪnɪʃ}}{{v. 减少；缩小}}{{His influence has diminished over the years.}}
{{dinosaur}}{{/ˈdaɪnəsɔːr}}{{n. 恐龙}}{{Dinosaurs became extinct millions of years ago.}}
{{diplomat}}{{/ˈdɪpləmæt}}{{n. 外交官}}{{The diplomat negotiated a peace agreement.}}
{{direct}}{{/dəˈrekt}}{{adj./v. 直接的；指导}}{{The movie is directed by a famous filmmaker.}}
{{direction}}{{/dəˈrekʃn}}{{n. 方向；指导}}{{The company is moving in a new direction.}}
{{disappoint}}{{/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪnt}}{{v. 使失望}}{{The test results disappointed the teacher.}}
{{discipline}}{{/ˈdɪsəplɪn}}{{n./v. 纪律；学科；训练}}{{Self-discipline is the key to success.}}
{{discount}}{{/ˈdɪskaʊnt}}{{n./v. 折扣；打折}}{{The store offers a 20% discount on all items.}}
{{discourage}}{{/dɪsˈkʌrɪdʒ}}{{v. 使气馁；劝阻}}{{Don't be discouraged by failure; keep trying.}}
{{discover}}{{/dɪsˈkʌvər}}{{v. 发现；找到}}{{Columbus discovered America in 1492.}}
{{discrimination}}{{/dɪˌskrɪmɪˈneɪʃn}}{{n. 歧视；辨别}}{{Racial discrimination is illegal in many countries.}}
{{discuss}}{{/dɪsˈkʌs}}{{v. 讨论；商议}}{{Let's discuss the issue at the meeting.}}
{{dismiss}}{{/dɪsˈmɪs}}{{v. 解雇；驳回；不理会}}{{The court dismissed the case due to lack of evidence.}}
{{disorder}}{{/dɪsˈɔːdər}}{{n. 混乱；疾病}}{{The patient was diagnosed with a sleep disorder.}}
{{display}}{{/dɪˈspleɪ}}{{v./n. 展示；显示}}{{The museum displays artifacts from ancient civilizations.}}
{{dispute}}{{/dɪˈspjuːt}}{{n./v. 争论；纠纷}}{{The dispute between the two companies was settled in court.}}
{{dissolve}}{{/dɪˈzɒlv}}{{v. 溶解；解散}}{{Sugar dissolves quickly in hot water.}}
{{distance}}{{/ˈdɪstəns}}{{n. 距离；远方}}{{The distance between the two cities is 300 kilometers.}}
{{distinguish}}{{/dɪˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ}}{{v. 区分；辨别}}{{It is hard to distinguish the twins from each other.}}
{{distribute}}{{/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt}}{{v. 分配；分发}}{{The volunteers distributed food to the homeless.}}
{{district}}{{/ˈdɪstrɪkt}}{{n. 区；地区}}{{The financial district is the busiest area in the city.}}
{{disturb}}{{/dɪˈstɜːb}}{{v. 打扰；使不安}}{{Please do not disturb me while I am studying.}}
{{diverse}}{{/daɪˈvɜːs}}{{adj. 多样的；不同的}}{{The university has a diverse student body.}}
{{divide}}{{/dɪˈvaɪd}}{{v. 分开；除；分配}}{{The river divides the city into two parts.}}
{{document}}{{/ˈdɒkjumənt}}{{n./v. 文件；记录}}{{Please bring all the necessary documents to the meeting.}}
{{domain}}{{/dəˈmeɪn}}{{n. 领域；域；领地}}{{She is an expert in the domain of artificial intelligence.}}
{{domestic}}{{/dəˈmestɪk}}{{adj. 国内的；家庭的}}{{Domestic flights are cheaper than international ones.}}
{{dominant}}{{/ˈdɒmɪnənt}}{{adj. 占主导地位的；显著的}}{{English is the dominant language in international business.}}
{{donate}}{{/dəʊˈneɪt}}{{v. 捐赠；捐献}}{{He donated blood to the local hospital.}}
{{doubt}}{{/daʊt}}{{n./v. 怀疑；不确定}}{{There is no doubt that education is important.}}
{{draft}}{{/drɑːft}}{{n./v. 草稿；起草}}{{She submitted the first draft of her thesis.}}
{{drag}}{{/dræɡ}}{{v./n. 拖；拽；累赘}}{{He dragged the heavy box across the floor.}}
{{drama}}{{/ˈdrɑːmə}}{{n. 戏剧；剧本}}{{She studied drama at a performing arts school.}}
{{draw}}{{/drɔː}}{{v. 画；拉；吸引}}{{The artist drew a portrait of the old man.}}
{{drift}}{{/drɪft}}{{v./n. 漂流；漂移}}{{The boat drifted slowly down the river.}}
{{drive}}{{/draɪv}}{{v./n. 驾驶；驱动；干劲}}{{She drives to work every day.}}
{{drop}}{{/drɒp}}{{v./n. 落下；下降；滴}}{{Prices dropped sharply after the announcement.}}
{{drown}}{{/draʊn}}{{v. 淹没；溺水}}{{The loud music drowned out their conversation.}}
{{due}}{{/djuː}}{{adj. 到期的；应有的；由于}}{{The report is due by the end of this week.}}
{{dull}}{{/dʌl}}{{adj. 枯燥的；阴暗的；钝的}}{{The lecture was so dull that many students fell asleep.}}
{{dump}}{{/dʌmp}}{{v./n. 倾倒；垃圾场}}{{It is illegal to dump waste in the river.}}
{{durable}}{{/ˈdjʊərəbl}}{{adj. 耐用的；持久的}}{{This material is very durable and can last for years.}}
{{duty}}{{/ˈdjuːti}}{{n. 职责；税}}{{It is our duty to protect the environment.}}
{{dwell}}{{/dwel}}{{v. 居住；细想}}{{She dwells on the past too much.}}
{{dynamic}}{{/daɪˈnæmɪk}}{{adj. 动态的；有活力的}}{{The city has a dynamic and vibrant culture.}}
